===Etymology===
From former {{term|robre|lang=es}}, from {{etyl|la|es}} {{term|robore|rōbore|lang=la}}, singular ablative of {{term|robur|rōbur|a kind of hard oak|lang=la}}, whence also Aragonese {{term|robre||oak|lang=an}} and Catalan {{term|roure|lang=ca||oak}}.

